<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil equities weighting raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil equities weighting raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its Brazil equities weighting to neutral from underweight.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to detail the move.</p>
</text>
